    "detailed_description": "This is a game about postman who has to deliver last 10 letters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is primarily a &quot;walking simulator&quot; genre you only have to click on mailbox and dont get caught by the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy idea of the game was to make a small &quot;Party horror game&quot; where you can watch your friends play and compete who can beat the game in better time, but you can also play alone, it's inspired by a game in which you have to collect 8 pages, but instead you are delivering 10 letters which are randomly chosen from 50 overall. Every house has a number and when you click on tab on your keyboard it shows you current letter with the house number and the house numbers are shown on the map. (press m on the keyboard) After you deliver 10 letters, you also have to leave the area to win the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControlls - Movement - WSAD<br />\r\n                  Current letter - TAB<br />\r\n                  Map - M<br />\r\n                  Deliver letter - left mouse button (aim on mailbox)<br />\r\n                  Sprint - Shift",
    "about_the_game": "This is a game about postman who has to deliver last 10 letters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game is primarily a &quot;walking simulator&quot; genre you only have to click on mailbox and dont get caught by the enemy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMy idea of the game was to make a small &quot;Party horror game&quot; where you can watch your friends play and compete who can beat the game in better time, but you can also play alone, it's inspired by a game in which you have to collect 8 pages, but instead you are delivering 10 letters which are randomly chosen from 50 overall. Every house has a number and when you click on tab on your keyboard it shows you current letter with the house number and the house numbers are shown on the map. (press m on the keyboard) After you deliver 10 letters, you also have to leave the area to win the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControlls - Movement - WSAD<br />\r\n                  Current letter - TAB<br />\r\n                  Map - M<br />\r\n                  Deliver letter - left mouse button (aim on mailbox)<br />\r\n                  Sprint - Shift",
    "short_description": "Just deliver 10 letters that's easy, right?",
